# ==============================================================================
# EVALUATION: BRIGHTNESS 2/2 (SHADOWS)
# ==============================================================================

A 0.2 255,255,255

# --- TEST 1: Vertical Spot Shadow ---
# "...put the camera aside so we can see the sphere, the plane and the 
# sphere's shadow on the plane."
# The camera is moved far to the top right (15, 10, -15) and angled downward 
# (-1, -0.5, 1) looking back at the origin.
C 15,10,-15   -1,-0.5,1   60

# "Place a vertical spot, a sphere and a plane. The spot lighting the sphere's 
# position to create a sphere shadow on the plane."
# The light is placed exactly 15 units above the sphere to act as a vertical spot.
L 0,15,0      0.9         255,255,255

# The floor plane to catch the shadow.
pl 0,-4,0     0,1,0       200,200,200

# The sphere resting above the floor plane at the origin.
sp 0,0,0      4           255,0,0
